{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2005-meet-science2-41","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2005,"subject":"physics","number":41,"points":null,"unitId":"physics-mechanics","unitLabel":"역학","topic":"속도·각속도","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["physics-mechanics","physics-electro"],"stem":"그림은오토바이가수평면과θ 0의각을이루는빗면으로이루어진\n도약대에서뛰어오르는모습을나타낸것이다.\n공중에서가속핸들을조작해서뒷바퀴의각속도의크기를증가시켰\n더니, 이효과에의해오토바이의두바퀴축을연결하는선이수평면과\n이루는각θ 가증가하였다.\n이에대한설명중옳은것을<보기>에서모두고른것은? (단,\n오토바이바퀴의각속도방향은변하지않으며운전자는가속핸들과\n브레이크조작외에아무동작도하지않는다.)\n<보기>\nㄱ. 공기저항이없다면이와같은현상은발생하지않는다.\nㄴ. 운전자의몸무게가클수록그효과에의해θ 는더빨리\n커진다.\nㄷ. 도약후공중에서브레이크를사용하여뒷바퀴의회전을\n멈추게한다면그효과에의해θ 는줄어든다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t015"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t016"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t017"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t018"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t019"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":669,"height":258,"region":0,"bbox":[30.456,54.822,267.6,103.2],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2005-meet-science2-41/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":765,"height":263,"region":0,"bbox":[14.056,297.222,306.0,105.2],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2005-meet-science2-41/02.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":14,"sourceRect":[82.744,599.178,416.5,1050.115],"width":333.756,"height":450.937,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[30.456,54.822,267.6,103.2],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-02","bbox":[14.056,297.222,306.0,105.2],"section":"stem"},{"id":"t001","type":"text","text":"41. 그림은오토바이가수평면과θ 0의각을이루는빗면으로이루어진","bbox":[5.0,5.0,318.54